For your Java backend learning, I would put it roughly here:

```text
                 Java
                  │
                  ▼
             SQL / Database
                  │
                  ▼
          HTTP / REST / JSON
                  │
                  ▼
            Servlet/Tomcat
                  │
                  ▼
             Spring Core
                  │
                  ▼
            Spring Boot
                  │
                  ▼
       ┌────────────────────┐
       │ Backend Application │
       └─────────┬──────────┘
                 │
       ┌─────────┴─────────┐
       ▼                   ▼
   Database          Redis/Cache
                           │
                           ▼
                    Message Queue
                           │
                           ▼
                  Distributed Systems
                           │
                           ▼
                    Microservices
```

You **don't need to learn Kafka/RabbitMQ before learning Spring Boot**.

First understand:

1. Java
2. SQL
3. HTTP
4. Servlet fundamentals
5. Spring
6. Spring Boot
7. REST API
8. Database integration
9. Transactions
10. **Then Message Queues**
11. Redis/cache
12. Microservices
13. Distributed systems

